{
  "schema": "langwich/3",
  "title": "La lista de la abuela Pepa",
  "standfirst": "Emily has one job this Saturday: buy everything for Grandma Pepa’s Sunday paella at Valencia’s Mercado Central — and only what’s on the list. What could go wrong?",
  "source_lang": "en",
  "target_lang": "es",
