      "name": "Plans: ir a + infinitive",
      "scene": "s1",
      "explanation": "To talk about plans and the near future, Spanish uses ir + a + infinitive — just like English ‘going to’. Only ir changes; the second verb stays in the infinitive.",
      "rule": "ir (voy, vas, va …) + a + infinitive",
      "table": {
